// Status: generalization_required (bridges: empty_case:A, hol_typedef_matroid)
Theorem SUBMATROID_GEN : forall A:set, (forall m :e matroid A, forall s c= A, forall x :e A, x :e matroid_set A (submatroid A m s) <-> matroid_span A m (matroid_set A m :/\: s) x) /\ forall m :e matroid A, forall s x c= A, forall x0 :e A, matroid_span A (submatroid A m s) x x0 <-> matroid_span A m x x0.
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Library/matroids.ml:940 / SUBMATROID
